## What to deliver

Build the Prism sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a thick cyan shell ring around a magenta core, the two bands
carrying the ring and diamond glyphs, at boss scale. When you are satisfied, stop:
the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
